 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey! How are you feeling?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.71,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm good, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.92,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How do I know if my wardrobe will fit in the new bedroom?",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Measure the wardrobe's height, width and depth, then measure the room, including the ceiling height.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And the doors?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Yes, every doorway and corridor it has to pass through. Tight corners on stairs are usually the real problem.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "It's one of those",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "tall ones that doesn't come apart.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.8,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then also measure it diagonally. Furniture often fits through by tilting, and the diagonal tells you if that works.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.0,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Huh. Clever.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 1.18,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "If it still won't fit, see if the new place has space for it in the living room, or consider selling it before the move.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg13"
  }
 ]
}
